docs {
  # Admin - Review and Resolve Report

  **Method:** `PUT`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/admin/reports/:id/review`
  **Auth:** Required (Admin Access Token)

  ## Description
  Allows an administrator to review, submit an official response note, update the report status, and automatically timestamp resolution.

  ## Request

  ### Headers
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |

  ### Body
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `status` | `string` | Yes | `UNDER_REVIEW`, `RESOLVED`, `REJECTED`, or `DISMISSED` |
  | `response` | `string` | Yes | Official moderator action/response notes (2 - 3000 chars) |

  ## Response
  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 1,
      "status": "RESOLVED",
      "reviewed_by_user_id": 99,
      "response": "The reported user has been investigated and issued a temporary warning.",
      "resolved_at": "2026-11-02T19:30:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```
}
